{"name":"按钮","description":"按钮是让用户在当前页面执行保存、提交、删除等操作的可点击控件 · 用户提交注册表单或保存设置时会点击按钮。链接负责前往别处；同一操作区应突出一个主要动作，其余动作降低层级。","quote":"帮我加个按钮，点了就能把内容存下来。","agentPrompt":"请整理账号设置页：保存资料、放弃本次修改和删除账号使用各自明确的按钮，删除前确认；“重设密码”保留为链接。不要改布局。分别触发保存、放弃修改和删除确认，确认保存中不能重复提交。","html":"<div class=\"detail-body detail-entry-button\"><section class=\"detail-hero\" id=\"detail-hero\"><div class=\"dh-head\"><h1>按钮<span>Button</span></h1></div><div class=\"dh-quote\"><span class=\"dh-quote-label\">你可能会说</span><p class=\"dh-quote-text\">帮我加个按钮，点了就能把内容存下来。</p></div><div class=\"dh-tagline\"><strong class=\"dh-summary-lead\">按钮是让用户在当前页面执行保存、提交、删除等操作的可点击控件</strong><span class=\"dh-summary-separator\" aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span>用户提交注册表单或保存设置时会点击按钮。链接负责前往别处；同一操作区应突出一个主要动作，其余动作降低层级。</span></div><div class=\"alias-row\" aria-label=\"也常被叫作\"><span>也常被叫作</span><em>操作按钮</em></div><div class=\"dh-demo\"><div class=\"dh-demo-viewport\"><div class=\"dh-demo-inner\"><div class=\"button-panel\">\n    <div class=\"button-panel-title\">登录账号</div>\n    <input class=\"demo-input\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"邮箱\" value=\"you@example.com\">\n    <button class=\"btn btn-primary button-panel-submit\">登 录</button>\n    <div class=\"button-panel-foot\"><span class=\"link-a\">忘记密码</span><span class=\"link-a\">注册新账号</span></div>\n  </div></div></div></div></section><div class=\"lesson-extras\"><section class=\"lesson-agent-prompt\" aria-labelledby=\"lesson-agent-title\"><h2 id=\"lesson-agent-title\">你可以这样告诉 AI Agent</h2><blockquote><span class=\"lesson-agent-quote\" aria-hidden=\"true\">“</span><p>请整理账号设置页：保存资料、放弃本次修改和删除账号使用各自明确的按钮，删除前确认；“重设密码”保留为链接。不要改布局。分别触发保存、放弃修改和删除确认，确认保存中不能重复提交。</p></blockquote></section></div><section class=\"distinctions\"><div class=\"section-title\">容易混淆？这样区分</div><div class=\"distinction-grid\"><div class=\"distinction-card\"><div class=\"distinction-head\"><span>按钮<small>Button</small></span><b>≠</b><a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/segmented?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"segmented\">分段控件 <b>Segmented</b></a></div><p><a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/button?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"button\" aria-label=\"按钮 Button\">按钮 <b>Button</b></a> 点一下就执行一个动作；<a class=\"c-ref c-link\" href=\"/vibe-hub/segmented?lang=zh\" data-ref=\"segmented\" aria-label=\"分段控件 Segmented\">分段控件 <b>Segmented</b></a> 表示一组选项中当前选中了哪一个，通常用来切换视图或模式。</p></div></div></section><section><div class=\"section-title\">组成结构 · Anatomy</div><div class=\"anat-wrap\"><div class=\"anat-stage\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"root\"><button class=\"btn btn-primary\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"icon\">＋</span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"label\">新建项目</span></button></span></div><div class=\"anat-parts\"><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"root\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">1</span><span class=\"pn\">按钮本体</span><span class=\"pe\">Button</span></button><span class=\"pd\">整块可点击区域，有主要 / 次要 / 危险等类型</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"icon\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">2</span><span class=\"pn\">图标</span><span class=\"pe\">Icon</span></button><span class=\"pd\">可选，用来强化动作含义；单独做图标按钮时要提供读屏可识别的名称，含义不直观时再配 Tooltip</span></div><div class=\"anat-part\" data-ap=\"label\"><button class=\"anat-part-trigger\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"idx\">3</span><span class=\"pn\">文案</span><span class=\"pe\">Label</span></button><span class=\"pd\">动词开头，说清点完会发生什么</span></div></div></div></section><section><div class=\"section-title\">常见变体 · Variants</div><div class=\"variant-grid\"><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">主要按钮<span>Primary</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><button class=\"btn btn-primary\">保存</button></div><div class=\"variant-when\">在同一操作区域留给最重要的动作</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">次要按钮<span>Outline</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><button class=\"btn btn-outline\">取消</button></div><div class=\"variant-when\">取消、返回这类退一步的操作用它</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">文字按钮<span>Text</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><button class=\"btn btn-text\">查看详情</button></div><div class=\"variant-when\">最轻量的操作，比如展开详情、收起</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">危险按钮<span>Danger</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><button class=\"btn btn-danger\">删除</button></div><div class=\"variant-when\">删除、清空等不可挽回的操作才用</div></div><div class=\"variant-card\"><div class=\"variant-name\">加载与禁用<span>Loading &amp; Disabled</span></div><div class=\"variant-demo\"><button class=\"btn btn-primary\" disabled><span class=\"btn-spin\"></span>提交中</button><button class=\"btn btn-outline\" disabled>不可点</button></div><div class=\"variant-when\">提交中或条件未满足时，防止重复点击</div></div></div></section><section class=\"scenes\"><div class=\"section-title\">典型使用场景</div><div class=\"scene-list\"><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">登录表单提交</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"max-width:320px;margin:0 auto;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:22px 24px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:14px\">欢迎回来</div>\n      <input class=\"demo-input\" style=\"width:100%;margin-bottom:10px\" value=\"you@example.com\">\n      <input class=\"demo-input\" style=\"width:100%;margin-bottom:14px\" type=\"password\" value=\"••••••••\">\n      <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"width:100%\">登 录</button>\n    </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"scene-item\"><div class=\"scene-cap\">删除确认弹窗</div><div class=\"scene-shot is-plain\"><div class=\"sc-body\"><div class=\"sc-body-inner\"><div style=\"position:relative;height:150px;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg-soft)\">\n      <div style=\"padding:14px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:60%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:85%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:45%\"></i></div>\n      <div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background:rgba(29,33,41,.32)\"></div>\n      <div style=\"position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);width:280px;max-width:calc(100% - 40px);background:var(--bg);border-radius:12px;padding:16px 18px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-float)\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:4px\">确认删除这个项目？</div>\n        <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2);margin-bottom:14px\">删除后无法恢复，请谨慎操作。</div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;gap:8px\"><button class=\"btn btn-outline\">取消</button><button class=\"btn btn-danger\">确认删除</button></div>\n      </div>\n    </div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"oil-ui-pro-recommendation\" aria-label=\"工具与支持\"><a class=\"oil-ui-pro-banner\" href=\"https://ui.oiloil.org/pro/\" target=\"_blank\" aria-label=\"了解 oil-ui-pro 完整版：让 AI 做 UI 设计的 Agent Skill\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"/vibe-hub/source/assets/services/oil-ui-pro-banner-zh.webp\" alt=\"oil-ui-pro：把 AI 的 UI 设计能力，推到极限。完整版多了交互、布局、配图、动效和反复评审。了解完整版。\" width=\"1600\" height=\"560\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></section><section class=\"references-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">延伸阅读 · 权威出处</div><div class=\"reference-list\"><a class=\"reference-link\" href=\"https://www.w3.org/WAI/ARIA/apg/patterns/button/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"reference-title\">按钮模式</span><span class=\"reference-source\">WAI-ARIA APG ↗</span></a><a class=\"reference-link\" href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Element/button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span class=\"reference-title\">&lt;button&gt; 按钮元素</span><span class=\"reference-source\">MDN ↗</span></a></div></section></div>","sourceUrl":"https://vibe-hub.org/button","markdown":"# 按钮Button\n\n你可能会说\n帮我加个按钮，点了就能把内容存下来。\n\n**按钮是让用户在当前页面执行保存、提交、删除等操作的可点击控件**·用户提交注册表单或保存设置时会点击按钮。链接负责前往别处；同一操作区应突出一个主要动作，其余动作降低层级。\n\n也常被叫作操作按钮\n\n## 你可以这样告诉 AI Agent\n\n> “\n> 请整理账号设置页：保存资料、放弃本次修改和删除账号使用各自明确的按钮，删除前确认；“重设密码”保留为链接。不要改布局。分别触发保存、放弃修改和删除确认，确认保存中不能重复提交。\n\n容易混淆？这样区分\n\n按钮Button**≠**[分段控件 **Segmented**](/vibe-hub/segmented?lang=zh)\n\n[按钮 **Button**](/vibe-hub/button?lang=zh) 点一下就执行一个动作；[分段控件 **Segmented**](/vibe-hub/segmented?lang=zh) 表示一组选项中当前选中了哪一个，通常用来切换视图或模式。\n\n组成结构 · Anatomy\n\n＋新建项目\n\n1按钮本体Button整块可点击区域，有主要 / 次要 / 危险等类型\n\n2图标Icon可选，用来强化动作含义；单独做图标按钮时要提供读屏可识别的名称，含义不直观时再配 Tooltip\n\n3文案Label动词开头，说清点完会发生什么\n\n常见变体 · Variants\n\n主要按钮Primary\n\n保存\n\n在同一操作区域留给最重要的动作\n\n次要按钮Outline\n\n取消\n\n取消、返回这类退一步的操作用它\n\n文字按钮Text\n\n查看详情\n\n最轻量的操作，比如展开详情、收起\n\n危险按钮Danger\n\n删除\n\n删除、清空等不可挽回的操作才用\n\n加载与禁用Loading & Disabled\n\n提交中不可点\n\n提交中或条件未满足时，防止重复点击\n\n典型使用场景\n\n登录表单提交\n\n欢迎回来\n\n      \n      \n      登 录\n\n删除确认弹窗\n\n确认删除这个项目？\n\n        \n删除后无法恢复，请谨慎操作。\n\n        \n取消确认删除\n\n延伸阅读 · 权威出处\n\n[按钮模式WAI-ARIA APG ↗](https://www.w3.org/WAI/ARIA/apg/patterns/button/)[<button> 按钮元素MDN ↗](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Element/button)"}